      "title": "He Vowed to Protect Her",
      "start_block": "B034",
      "end_block": "B055",
      "hook": "A thug violently shoves Juliana to the ground and she cries out as she crashes onto the stone path.",
      "cliffhanger": "Alexander stands between Juliana and the thugs as the thug challenges 'You want to fight us, veteran?' and the music cuts.",
      "why": "Physical violence against the heroine creates instant outrage, then the protector arrives and the fight is left hanging.",
      "context_gap": "Who Alexander is and why he is so protective of Juliana."
    },
    {
      "title": "He Charges Into the Night",
      "start_block": "B042",
