      "hook": "A thug hoists a club to crush the herbs as Juliana screams 'Stop!'",
      "cliffhanger": "Alexander towers over the thugs as one sneers 'You want to fight us, veteran?' and the scene cuts on a tense cello swell.",
      "why": "Starts on an imminent act of violence, then delivers the hero's dramatic entrance and ends on the unresolved confrontation.",
      "context_gap": "The history between Alexander and Juliana and why he is so enraged."
